WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.534 --> 00:00:18.024
The next day at three o'clock, we were back at the front door.

2
00:00:18.025 --> 00:00:22.745
Once again there was a rustle of silk as the lady of the house approached.

3
00:00:22.746 --> 00:00:25.578
But this time her frown was deeper.

4
00:00:25.579 --> 00:00:30.020
"York, you must put those horses' heads higher," she ordered.

5
00:00:30.021 --> 00:00:33.090
"They aren't fit to be seen."

6
00:00:33.091 --> 00:00:40.645
"I beg your pardon, my lady," York said respectfully, "but these horses are not accustomed to wearing a checkrein.

7
00:00:40.646 --> 00:00:44.682
Your husband thought it would be better to get them used to it slowly.

8
00:00:44.683 --> 00:00:48.697
But if you prefer, I can tighten them up a little more."

9
00:00:48.698 --> 00:00:52.323
"Do so," she said.

10
00:00:52.324 --> 00:00:55.227
York shortened our checkreins himself.

11
00:00:55.228 --> 00:00:58.747
He did it only slightly, but even that made a difference.

12
00:00:58.748 --> 00:01:01.843
At first it wasn't too bad.

13
00:01:01.844 --> 00:01:08.030
Then we came to a steep hill, and I began to understand why Ginger hated the checkrein so much.

14
00:01:08.031 --> 00:01:13.067
I wanted to put my head forward to help pull the carriage up the hill, as usual.

15
00:01:13.068 --> 00:01:19.232
But this time I couldn't, and my back and legs felt the strain.

16
00:01:19.233 --> 00:01:23.719
"Now you see what it's like," Ginger said when we were back in our stalls.

17
00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:25.720
"It's still not too bad.

18
00:01:25.721 --> 00:01:29.119
As long as it doesn't get much worse, I'll be fine.

19
00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:34.310
They treat us well otherwise. But if they try to make it too tight, look out!

20
00:01:34.311 --> 00:01:38.633
I can't bear it, and I won't!"

21
00:01:38.634 --> 00:01:43.854
Day by day, hole by hole, the reins were shortened.

22
00:01:43.855 --> 00:01:47.538
My work got more and more difficult and uncomfortable.

23
00:01:47.539 --> 00:01:53.300
I used to look forward to being put in harness. Now I hated it.

24
00:01:53.301 --> 00:01:57.834
Ginger seemed unhappy too. But she didn't say much about it.

25
00:01:57.835 --> 00:02:01.155
Several days passed where York didn't shorten the reins any more.

26
00:02:01.156 --> 00:02:07.091
I thought the worst was over. As it turned out, I was wrong.

27
00:02:07.092 --> 00:02:09.995
One day we pulled up to the house as usual.

28
00:02:09.996 --> 00:02:15.445
"Aren't you going to get those horses' heads up, York?" the lady complained.

29
00:02:15.446 --> 00:02:19.489
"Raise them right now—they've had plenty of time to adjust!"

30
00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:24.319
York nodded without saying anything. He came to me first.

31
00:02:24.320 --> 00:02:30.130
Lifting my head up, he fastened the checkrein so tightly that I could hardly move.

32
00:02:30.131 --> 00:02:32.393
Next he went to Ginger.

33
00:02:32.394 --> 00:02:36.834
I could see by the look in her eyes that she knew exactly what was coming.

34
00:02:36.835 --> 00:02:40.658
She started jerking her head up and down against the bit.

35
00:02:40.659 --> 00:02:48.477
Then, as soon as York unbuckled the rein to tighten it, Ginger reared up onto her hind legs.

36
00:02:48.478 --> 00:02:53.495
Her knee hit York in the nose, knocking him back so hard that his hat flew off.

37
00:02:53.496 --> 00:02:57.281
He hopped back up right away and rushed toward her head.

38
00:02:57.282 --> 00:03:00.493
A groom standing nearby also tried to grab her.

39
00:03:00.494 --> 00:03:03.162
Ginger was a match for both of them.

40
00:03:03.163 --> 00:03:06.801
She kept bucking, rearing, and kicking out frantically.

41
00:03:06.802 --> 00:03:14.071
At last she tripped over the harness pole and fell, accidentally kicking one of my hind legs on her way down.

42
00:03:14.072 --> 00:03:17.183
There's no telling what she would have done next.

43
00:03:17.184 --> 00:03:19.480
But this time York was too quick for her.

44
00:03:19.481 --> 00:03:22.686
He sat on her head to keep her from getting up.

45
00:03:22.687 --> 00:03:33.207
Soon several people were cutting Ginger free from her harness, while a groom quickly unbuckled me from the carriage.

46
00:03:33.208 --> 00:03:38.467
He led me back to my stall, put me inside, and hurried off again.

47
00:03:38.468 --> 00:03:41.247
I was still in my harness with my head tied up.

48
00:03:41.248 --> 00:03:45.194
After what had just happened, I was feeling upset.

49
00:03:45.195 --> 00:03:50.564
If I'd ever been the type to kick or rear, I'm sure I would have done it then.

50
00:03:50.565 --> 00:03:57.710
But instead I just stood there, angry and uncomfortable, with my leg throbbing from that kick.

51
00:03:57.711 --> 00:04:03.732
A few minutes later two grooms led Ginger in. She looked tired and bruised.

52
00:04:03.733 --> 00:04:09.695
York followed, and after watching them put her in her stall, he came to me.

53
00:04:09.696 --> 00:04:14.298
"Stupid checkreins," he muttered as he set my head free.

54
00:04:14.299 --> 00:04:18.341
"I suspected there would be a problem after what Manly told me.

55
00:04:18.342 --> 00:04:22.392
I wish the earl could have talked some sense into his wife.

56
00:04:22.393 --> 00:04:26.211
There was no reason for this to happen."

57
00:04:26.212 --> 00:04:28.548
He noticed my injured leg.

58
00:04:28.549 --> 00:04:33.562
Calling in a groom, he ordered him to clean it and put some lotion on it.

59
00:04:33.563 --> 00:04:36.875
Ginger was never hitched to the carriage again.

60
00:04:36.876 --> 00:04:44.177
When she'd recovered from the incident, the earl's son said he wanted to try her as his riding horse.

61
00:04:44.178 --> 00:04:49.721
As for me, from then on I was paired with a horse named Max.

62
00:04:49.722 --> 00:04:55.278
He was used to the tight checkrein, and one day I asked him how he stood it.

63
00:04:55.279 --> 00:04:59.462
"I bear it because I must," he replied simply.

64
00:04:59.463 --> 00:05:04.237
"But I'm sure it's shortening my life, and it will shorten yours too."

65
00:05:04.238 --> 00:05:06.514
I suspected he was right.

66
00:05:06.515 --> 00:05:14.313
And that made me feel I had no friends at all among the humans at my new home.
